Z||000032||87ECO5||05-03-2000||02:36 PM||||I try to keep the images somewhat small because I don't want to eat up server space.  If anyone would like to see a larger version, let me know.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mohican_1.jpg"> <P>Nine cars showed up.  Let me see if I can name them:<P>top row left:  87ECO5's '87 econo-coupe<BR>top row middle:  2M4 Dale's '87 econo-coupe<BR>top row right:  ????? '87 sport coupe<BR>middle row left:  Dwayne and Rita Steven's '87 GT<BR>middle row middle:  ????? '88 GT<BR>middle row right:  Ot Huster's '84 SE<BR>bottom row left:  Keith Napier's '88 econo-coupe (with QUAD4 conversion)<BR>bottom row middle:  John Altman's '86 SE (with S/C 3800 conversion)<BR>bottom row right:  John Altman's wife's '85 GT (with Pisa fastback conversion)<P>What a blast!  Let's do it again ...||||reg||14
